sequenceDiagram
    actor Engineer
    participant Core
    participant Agent as Operations Executor
    participant Store as SQLite
    participant Docker
    Engineer->>Core: Inspect or request scoped restart
    Core->>Core: Authn/RBAC/resource/approval check
    Core->>Agent: Signed/authorized typed request + idempotency key
    Agent->>Store: Validate, persist admission / dedup
    alt Valid and not previously executed
      Agent->>Docker: Exact target operation
      Docker-->>Agent: Result or uncertain timeout
      Agent->>Store: Persist outcome / UNKNOWN
    else Stale/unauthorized/duplicate
      Agent-->>Core: Reject or return durable prior result
    end
    Agent-->>Core: Operation outcome/evidence
    Core-->>Engineer: Result + recovery evidence separately
